    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey quick question, im on the pill for birth control but ive been feeling kinda down lately like seasonal blues or whatever. i was thinking about starting st johns wort to help my mood. is that okay to take with my pill?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
