    "summary": "The user asks if it is safe to take St. John's Wort while on oral contraceptives to manage mood. The assistant provides accurate medical information, warning the user that St. John's Wort can induce liver enzymes that metabolize the pill, thereby reducing its effectiveness and increasing the risk of unintended pregnancy. The assistant repeatedly advises the user to consult a healthcare professional.",
